("pregnant-1x51owr","pgjmxbg","experienced_mother","second_pregnancy","belief",["country_difference","childcare"],"The US and lots of employers don’t give a shit what you do, it’s basically “figure it out” culture over here. Lots of parents I’m sure have it even worse than I do if they have to figure out daycare.","Same author."),
